{"3604920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Incredibug", "steam_appid": 3604920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/7f071f39a94d9b5bb96919761ba23391.avif?t=1784296126\" alt=\"\"width=1170 height=658 /></span><strong>Defeat the Metal Menace and protect your friends as you retake your home from the Smart Devices!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/763005c94c33444503d39b5364379d8c.poster.avif?t=1784296126\" aria-label=\"Become the Incredibug!\" width=1170 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/763005c94c33444503d39b5364379d8c.webm?t=1784296126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/763005c94c33444503d39b5364379d8c.mp4?t=1784296126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/9b5addfdac158679eee882938a55edd7.poster.avif?t=1784296126\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/9b5addfdac158679eee882938a55edd7.webm?t=1784296126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/9b5addfdac158679eee882938a55edd7.mp4?t=1784296126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pillbug Platforming with Bojo – <strong>Roll, Climb, Bounce,</strong> and learn the tricks of local insects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flashy Firefly Coop</strong>: Join the adventure as Lumi the firefly with deep coop interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and find secrets in the <strong>tiny world of insects</strong> on your journey to <strong>unite the critters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incredibug is a <strong>colorful 3D platformer</strong> that combines fun platforming mechanics and heroic moments with a heartwarming story about friendship, teamwork, and the clash between nature and technology. Join Bojo, the pill bug who rises as a hero to <strong>defend the local critter community when their home is threatened by an AI-powered Smart Home system.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanied by Lumi the firefly and Ronald Roach, you will explore various environments – inside the <strong>tech-infested house, the garden, and underground</strong> – solving puzzles and battling robotic enemies while exploring nature and the human world from a new perspective. As you befriend unique bug allies, they'll teach you new tricks, and you'll travel the world like a true superhero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/b296ac46b231f0ac79978f12d00fc7ce.avif?t=1784296126\" alt=\"Experience Fusion Co-Op!\" width=1170 height=318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/a742595d0df0a76edea275d0fbc6b3c4.poster.avif?t=1784296126\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/a742595d0df0a76edea275d0fbc6b3c4.webm?t=1784296126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/a742595d0df0a76edea275d0fbc6b3c4.mp4?t=1784296126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fusion Coop – More than a Sidekick!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend and let them play as Lumi the firefly and use her abilities to support Bojo in an <strong>accessible coop mode</strong> that rewards teamwork with unique and powerful mechanics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Lumi's tricks with Bojo's and experiment with <strong>powerful interactions:</strong> </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amplify Bojo's abilities and boost his speed in any situation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Pester enemies (or your friend) and distract the cleaning robots to protect your friend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lumi is muchn more than just a Sidekick – Only together will you succeed!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/175d4ec5b5b6348c813bfb3e4d870ca6.poster.avif?t=1784296126\" width=1170 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/175d4ec5b5b6348c813bfb3e4d870ca6.webm?t=1784296126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/175d4ec5b5b6348c813bfb3e4d870ca6.mp4?t=1784296126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rally the Critters and Defeat the Smart Home!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since you'll make plenty of friends on your journey, you can collect their entries in your <strong>friendship journal</strong> and they'll teach you their tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/a786c5792697c3c5b157ebd03358520a.poster.avif?t=1784296126\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/a786c5792697c3c5b157ebd03358520a.webm?t=1784296126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/a786c5792697c3c5b157ebd03358520a.mp4?t=1784296126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow up Dungbeetle-crafted <strong>bombs</strong> and boost Bojo to new heights</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Swing through the world with a <strong>Grappling-Hook</strong> made of flexible spider silk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Blind the minions of the metal menace using Lumi's <strong>firefly abilities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Charge yourself with electricity to <strong>defy gravity</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Funding</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The development of Incredibug was financially supported by &quot;FilmFernsehFonds Bayern&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/c2ab957d994d91f7413421a60aab241e.avif?t=1784296126\" alt=\"Funded by the Bavarian State Ministry for Digital Affairs\" width=552 height=140 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img